<title>PERU: Peru's money base expands 1.2 pct in May vs April.</title>
<headline>Peru's money base expands 1.2 pct in May vs April.</headline>
<dateline>LIMA 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Peru's money base expanded 1.2 percent during May to stand at 3.787 billion soles at the end of the month, compared with the end of April, the Central Reserve Bank said Tuesday.</p>
<p>The money base ended last year at 3.996 billion soles, up from 3.658 billion soles at the start of 1996.</p>
<p>((-- Saul Hudson, Lima newsroom, 511 221-2134))</p>
